OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FElizabeth Alker celebrates summer
OL,7,     Fmusic-making in the UK and beyond,
OL,8,     Fincluding the Spanish National
OL,9,     FOrchestra's debut performance at
OL,10,     Fthe BBC Proms.
OL,11,G1500 Choral Evensong
OL,12,     FSolemn Vespers from Buckfast Abbey
OL,13,     Fon the Feast of St Mary Magdalene,
OL,14,     Fwith music by Scheidemann,
OL,15,     FGuerrero and Martin Baker.
OL,16,G1600 Composer of the Week: Handel
OL,17,     F3/5. Donald Macleod explores
OL,18,     FHandel's time with the Duke of
OL,19,     FChandos, where he composed major
OL,20,     Fworks including the Chandos
OL,21,     FAnthems and Acis and Galatea.
