OL,5,G1700 In Tune
OL,6,     FPetroc chats to the Unthanks and
OL,7,     Fintroduces live music from
OL,8,     FFretwork & Ian Bostridge.
OL,9,G1900 BBC Proms 2026
OL,10,     FLive at the BBC Proms: the BBC
OL,11,     FSymphony Orchestra, conducted by
OL,12,     FSakari Oramo, performs Mahler's
OL,13,     FSymphony No. 6 plus Kurtag's
OL,14,     Fhaunting elegy, Stele, Op.33.
OL,15,G2200 Night Tracks
OL,16,     FSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,17,     Fadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,18,     Ffor late-night listening, from
OL,19,     Fclassical to contemporary and
OL,20,     Feverything in between.
